    "first": {
      "commands": [
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "うわなつかしいな"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "だいぶ荒れてるけど本当に妖怪が出たりしてな"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ははっ"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "まずどこいく？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "まずは女子トイレじゃない？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "当時からトイレの花子さんの噂は流行ってたし"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "行こう！"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "今更だけど俺らって女子トイレ入っていいの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "マジで今更何を言ってんだよ"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "トイレの花子さんの噂を試す"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "やっぱり何も起きないね"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "そりゃそうだろ"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "でもトイレといえば鏡の噂もあったよね"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "鏡に祈る"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "その瞬間何かが変わった"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "それと同時に遅れて答えるように女子トイレのドアが開く"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "トイレの花子さん登場"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "あなたたちはこっち側の世界に来てしまったのよ"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "鏡というのはこっちとあっちの橋渡しの役割を担っているから"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "つまり鏡に祈った瞬間こっちの世界に来てしまったというわけか"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "信じられないけどこうなったら信じるしかないか"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "それで、元の世界に戻る方法はあるのか？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "屋上に行けば全てがわかる"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "SYSTEM_COMMAND",
          "text": "STOP_BGM"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "私からはそれだけ伝えておくわ"
        },
